  displayName: Rathive Queen
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e166904a6a78348a75b6d53a94bd8f, type: 3}
  description: The Rathive Queen is a towering, bloated ratkin matriarch, far larger
    than a man with a heavy tail dragging like a cord behind her. Despite her mass
    she does not shamble - she moves with a grim, purposeful medium pace, escorted
    by her hive. She speaks in unnervingly clear speech, issuing orders and threats
    with regal certainty, as if the entire swarm is an extension of her will.
